sequenceDiagram
  actor Overseas as Overseas (Trịnh Đức Phương)
  participant FE as Step4Matrix.js
  participant Dialog as POCreateDialog.js
  participant API as poApi (Axios)
  participant Ctrl as POController
  participant Svc as POBatchCreationService
  participant State as POState (DraftState)
  participant Repo as PurchaseOrderRepository
  participant Bus as ApplicationEventPublisher
  participant L1 as POAuditListener
  participant L2 as PONotificationListener

  Overseas->>FE: Phân chia SL cho từng Site (matrix)
  Overseas->>FE: Click "Xem trước"
  FE->>Dialog: Open preview dialog
  Dialog-->>Overseas: Hiển thị N PO sẽ tạo + cảnh báo thiếu
  Overseas->>Dialog: Click "Gửi đơn đặt hàng"
  Dialog->>API: POST /api/po/batch
  API->>Ctrl: createPOBatch(requestId, orders)
  Ctrl->>Svc: createPOsFromInventory(...)

  loop for each Site
    Svc->>Svc: new PurchaseOrder(status=DRAFT)
    Svc->>State: POStateRegistry.get(DRAFT)
    Svc->>Repo: save(po)
    Svc->>State: po.send() ← State Pattern transition
    State->>State: applyTransition(SENT, SentState)
    Svc->>Repo: save(po) [status=SENT]
    Svc->>Bus: publishEvent(POSentEvent)
  end

  Note over Bus: Transaction commits (AFTER_COMMIT)
  Bus->>L1: onPOSent(event)
  L1->>L1: auditService.log("PO_SENT", ...)
  Bus->>L2: onPOSent(event)
  L2->>L2: notificationService.send to Site

  Svc-->>Ctrl: List<PurchaseOrderDTO>
  Ctrl-->>API: ApiResponse.ok(N POs)
  API-->>Dialog: response
  Dialog-->>Overseas: Hiện thông báo "Đã tạo N PO"
